        "@language": "fr-ca",
        "@value": "CIRCUS  — We will be presenting our family  circus show  SANTÉ!  , at John Valenzuela Youth Center in  Tucson  on  April 15  at  6:00 PM !  Expect breathtaking acrobatics, hand balancing, and many other delightful surprises that the whole family will enjoy! Come spend the evening with us!  For more"
