        "@language": "fr-ca",
        "@value": "CIRCUS  — We’re coming to  Bucknell University’s Homecoming  on  October 4  with our  free circus show SANTÉ!  It will start at  4:15 PM ! Expect high-flying acrobatics, dazzling juggling, trampoline tricks, and nonstop fun.  Bring your friends — we can’t wait to see you there!"
