        "@language": "fr-ca",
        "@value": "CIRCUS —  On September 21 we will be at the Tivoli Mermorial Recration Park! We will be presenting our  FREE   show SANTÉ!  at 3pm! The  Kikasse terrace  will also be open with some kombucha and pop corn!   Thanks to PS21 Chatham for this free event!  Come enjoy with us! For more information  click"
