      {
        "@language": "fr-ca",
        "@value": "CIRCUS- FOOD TRUCK — At the Lewiston arts festival, you'll have the chance to chat with them, discover their art in greater depth, and maybe find a piece of art you'll love!  Circus Kikasse will be present at this exceptional event! We'll be presenting our SANTÉ! show on Saturday August 10 at 1pm."
